From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 12:20:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tapdisk: vbd: split per-queue state into td_vbd_queue_t for
 multi-queue

Extract request lists (new, pending, failed, completed), mutex, sector
counters, watchdog state and timestamps from td_vbd_t into a new
td_vbd_queue_t struct. Each VBD now holds an array of queues indexed by
td_queue_id_t.

Refactor VBD request processing functions (issue, kick, retry, check
progress) to operate on individual queues rather than the whole VBD.
Update all callers: blktap, lcache, llcache, qcow2, NBD server, td-req,
and the server main loop.

Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
